  "statement": "What is the value of the following expression? \\[ \\begin{aligned} &2\\left(1-\\dfrac{1}{2}\\right)+3\\left(1-\\dfrac{1}{3}\\right) \\\\ &\\quad {}+4\\left(1-\\dfrac{1}{4}\\right)+\\cdots \\\\ &\\quad {}+10\\left(1-\\dfrac{1}{10}\\right) \\end{aligned} \\]",
